<title>NETHERLANDS: EU wheat prices seen above intervention in 1997.</title>
<headline>EU wheat prices seen above intervention in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch agriculture minister said on Wednesday he expected European Union wheat prices to remain above intervention levels in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;Wheat prices are currently above intervention and they are likely to remain so in the coming year,&quot; Jozias van Aartsen told journalists at a news briefing.</p>
<p>The Netherlands assumes the rotating six-month presidency of the European Union on January 1, 1997.</p>
